      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ATUA MAGIC NZ (2) is a progressive colt who scored when resuming at Wagga two starts back then was highly competitive again at his latest appearance at Melton, beaten a head into second after leading and fighting well. Has the speed to take advantage of another good draw and drops to a distance where he strikes at 50 per cent. Has the class to take care of this field. JACCKA EVAN NZ (9) made a winning return at his latest appearance two weeks ago, leading and getting home by 7.6 metres at Wagga. Draws on the back line this time but with even luck he could go on with it. FOURTH RESPONSE (4) came from wider for a respectable third at his most recent appearance at Melton having won two of his previous three outings in Tasmania. Go well along with KOSIMO (5) who showed pleasing improvement last time out when third from the back line at Cranbourne.",
